 ["The Gram Sabha is a meeting of all the adult voters of a village. It discusses plans, budgets and problems of the village.","It is the base of democracy because every adult can speak and vote on local decisions.","The Gram Sabha meets regularly and checks the work of the Gram Panchayat. Women and people of all communities take part."],
